{
  "id": "MOD_Spellsmith",
  "name": "Spellsmith",
  "description": "A smith of other people's spells. The Spellsmith barely casts anything of their own: their craft is reworking the attacks you learned from your other classes, lobbing them as grenades, beating them into hammers, burying them in the deck or strapping them to walking bombs. When pressed, the whole workshop runs cold.\n\nTake it beside another class with mod attacks: its forms do nothing to vanilla skills or its own lance. Example class: shows how passives, stances and loaded charges reshape other classes' skills (\"modifies\") and stack. Favors [SMT] and [REC].",
  "archetype": "Intellect",
  "iconFrom": "SKILLTREE_Pyromaniac",
  "attributePriorities": {
    "Smarts": 4,
    "Recognition": 2
  },
  "effects": [
